    <item>
      <title>你在前台摸鱼聊天，AI在后台把代码写完了：Claude Code这波更新有点逆天</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aiclaude-code-20260630174004814-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 17:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
